<title>UK: Ionica raises 215 mln stg for UK service rollout.</title>
<headline>Ionica raises 215 mln stg for UK service rollout.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>British telephone operator Ionica Plc said on Wednesday it had raised about 215 million stg through debt offerings and a private equity placement to fund the rollout of its UK service.</p>
<p>The financings included an offering in the U.S. high-yield debt market of 15 percent senior discount notes due 2007, which raised 125 million stg, the company said in a statement. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
